---
const version = __APP_VERSION__;
const build = new Date(__BUILD_TIME__);
const human = new Intl.DateTimeFormat("ja-JP", {
  year: "numeric",
  month: "2-digit",
  day: "2-digit",
  hour: "2-digit",
  minute: "2-digit",
  hour12: false,
  timeZone: "Asia/Tokyo",
}).format(build);
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<footer>
  <div class="footer-content">
    <div class="copy-right">
      <p>&copy; 2026 Uliboooo. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="site-info">
      <p>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/Uliboooo/blog"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="link--underline link--external">View Source</a
        >
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="why-snails">
    <div class="why-snail-c">
      <h2>Why "Compute on Snails?"</h2>
      <p>
        ハードウェアに寄らない抽象化された計算機が好きなため、計算機の要件を満たすのならばかたつむの上で計算してもいいという冗談から。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</footer>

<style>
  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid #545454;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    font-family: var(--base-fonts-sans);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;

    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;

    .footer-content {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-around;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .why-snails {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;

      .why-snail-c {
        width: 75%;
        h2 {
          margin-top: 0;
          font-size: 1rem;
        }
        p {
          font-size: 0.8rem;
        }
      }
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    footer {
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      .copy-right,
      .site_info {
        justify-content: center;
      }
    }
  }
</style>
